<title>USA: Teamsters, UPS reach tentative contract deal -- CNN.</title>
<headline>Teamsters, UPS reach tentative contract deal -- CNN.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Administration sources said the Teamsters union has reached a tentative agreement to end their 15-day strike against United Parcel Service, Cable News Network said on Monday.</p>
<p>CNN administration sources were soon confirmed by sources close to the talks.</p>
<p>-- Washington newsroom, ((202-898-8300))</p>
